# The current file is a configureation file template for the hg_watchdog feature. the configureation file uses the installation path,
# data path, and other startup options as configureation parameters.
#
# Among them, the installation path and data path are required and must be provided. in addtion, the configureation identifiers for each
# group must be correct. Other startup options are optional, such as -l logfile.
#
# In the template:
#		instanceno-installpath: represents the installation path.
#		instanceno-installdata: represents the data path.
#		instanceno-option:represents optional parameters.
#
# instanceno is instance1, instance2, ..., instancen, the number in each group must be the same.
#
# Example is shown below:
#
instance1-installpath:/home/markbo/sourcecode/Develop/hgv9/gerrit/v9-main/debug
instance1-installdata:/home/markbo/sourcecode/Develop/hgv9/gerrit/v9-main/debug/data
instance1-option: -l /home/markbo/sourcecode/Develop/hgv9/gerrit/v9-main/debug/logfile

instance2-installpath:/home/markbo/sourcecode/Develop/hgv9/gerrit/v9-main/debug
instance2-installdata:/home/markbo/sourcecode/Develop/hgv9/gerrit/v9-main/debug/mysdata